error: corsa not found

vize check requires 'typescript@^7' to be installed.

To install, run one of the following:

  npm install -D typescript@^7  # npm
  pnpm add -D typescript@^7  # pnpm
  yarn add -D typescript@^7  # yarn
  bun add -D typescript@^7  # bun
